  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Profile bio links shows incorrect value or doesn't show it at all when editing. It happens when you go back to your profile after viewing another profile.\nPrerequisites:\nYou have to have at least one link added to your profile bio.\nTo reproduce:\n1) Click \"Go to profile\" on the image in top left corner.\n2) Click on any of your friends on the right side.\n3) Go back to your profile by clicking \"Back\" in browser navigation or by clicking \"Go to profile\".\n4) Click on your bio link to edit it.\n5) The value is empty or it shows a value from previously viewed profile.\nTested on Firefox and Chrome.",
